  "description": "Design system and EVM/EPC reusable components (KPI strip, gauges CPI/SPI/PF, S-curves, Gantt, WBS tree grid, R9C, risk heatmap, change orders, purchase orders, engineering deliverables, lookahead grid) for .NET 10 Blazor WebApp (Interactive Server) on top of Syncfusion.Blazor. Proprietary — requires a commercial agreement with Cayaqui.",
